        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35470"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A loosely defined group of drugs that tend to reduce the activity of the central nervous system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
