        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mixture consisting of &gt;= 90% 22,23-dihydroavermectin B1a (R = Me) and &lt;= 10% 22,23-dihydroavermectin B1b (R = H). A semi-synthetic derivative of abamectin, it is used as a broad-spectrum antiparasite medication, particularly against worms (except tapeworms), although it is also effective against most mites and some lice.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <chebi:charge>0</chebi:charge>
        <chebi:formula>C47H71O14R</chebi:formula>
