    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005623">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE. The basic structural and functional unit of all organisms. Includes the plasma membrane and any external encapsulating structures such as the cell wall and cell envelope.</obo:IAO_0000115>
