        <obo:IAO_0000115>The chemical reactions and pathways involving a phenol, any compound containing one or more hydroxyl groups directly attached to an aromatic carbon ring.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UM-BBD_pathwayID:phe</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>carbolic acid metabolic process</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
