        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that results in a change in state or activity of a cell or an organism (in terms of movement, secretion, enzyme production, gene expression, etc.) as a result of a stimulus indicating a decline in oxygen levels to trace amounts, &lt;0.1%.</obo:IAO_0000115>
