        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>cooperative behavior</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0035176</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Behavior such as predation which involves members of different species is not social. Communication between members of different species is also not social behavior.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>social behavior</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
