        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0036293</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>This term should be used when a decrease in oxygen levels is not considered a stress response. For a hypoxic stress response, consider instead &apos;response to hypoxia ; GO:0001666&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
