            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which genetic material, in the form of chromosomes, is organized into specific structures and then physically separated and apportioned to two or more sets during M phase of the meiotic cell cycle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
