        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process resulting in division and partitioning of components of a cell to form more cells; may or may not be accompanied by the physical separation of a cell into distinct, individually membrane-bounded daughter cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Cell_division</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
