            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The cell cycle phase which follows anaphase during M phase of mitosis and meiosis and during which the chromosomes arrive at the poles of the cell and the division of the cytoplasm starts.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Telophase</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
