        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001018"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A quality of inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s disposition to move freely.</obo:IAO_0000115>
