            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A variability quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of whether the bearer exhibits shape variation or change.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>quality</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
