        <obo:IAO_0000115>Contents or structures of the cell are oriented on the opposite side of the cell compared to control animals; In C. elegans, this can result in the fate pattern of descendants being flipped.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>WBPhenotype:0000155</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>cell polarity reversed</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
