        <owl:annotatedTarget>Variations in the placement of the polar body formed in the first division of meiosis of a primary oocyte, compared to control. A polar body is the by-product of meiosis (destined to degenerate) in female or hermaphrodite animals.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>WB:WBPerson2021</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>WB:WBPerson557</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
