        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any variation in the small linear ridges running along the lateral lines of the cuticle, lengthwise along the body compared to control (Wormatlas).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>alae abnormal</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
