        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals exhibit an increased girth compared to a control animal of the same developmental stage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>increased girth</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
