        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Muscle contractions that make up the defecation motor program are repeated before the onset of the next cycle unlike in control animals.</owl:annotatedTarget>
