        <obo:IAO_0000115>The specialized tissue of the reproductive tract that produces gamete is shifted from its customary place as defined by control.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ectopic gonad</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
