    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/WBPhenotype_0001033">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/WBPhenotype_0001215"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any variation in the spatial pattern of proliferation and differentiation in the germ line compared to control. In C. elegans, this refers to an ectopic mass of proliferating germ cells that occupies the proximal adult germ line, a region normally occupied by gametes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
