        <obo:IAO_0000115>The period during which a worm usually does not lay eggs is short compared with control animals, based on the analysis of the distribution of the log intervals of egg-laying events.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>WBPhenotype:0001070</oboInOwl:id>
