        <owl:annotatedTarget>Animals exhibit variations in the structure or composition of the microtuble-based fibrillar core, axoneme, of the cilia of the neurons that project through the sensillum pore to the outside of the animal, compared to that observed in control animals.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>WB:WBPaper00000932</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>WB:WBPerson557</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
