        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any variation in the process whose specific outcome is the progression of the male tail over time, from its formation to the mature structure, compared to control.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>male tail development abnormal</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
