        <obo:IAO_0000115>Variations in the synaptic currents that are elicited by firing an action potential in a population of axons, compared to control.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>evoked postsynaptic current abnormal</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
