        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals exhibit a reduction in the frequency of oscillations between adjacent body segments from that observed for control animals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>WBPhenotype:0002330</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
