        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals lack a properly developed posterior region compared to control. In C. elegans, mutants exhibit a severely deformed posterior region with a variable knob-like shape; accompanied by arrest at about the time of hatching with fairly normal pharyngeal and anterior development. Most mutants arrest as L1 larvae, and 5% do not hatch.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>Nob</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>WBPhenotype:0001492</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>no back end</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
