        <owl:annotatedTarget>The characteristic organization of actin filaments into I-bands is disrupted. In C. elegans, actin filaments no longer appear as thin continuous longitudinal stripes along the muscle quadrants.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>WB:WBPaper00001894</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
