        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals fail to respond to the concentration of ethanol that elicits a response in control animals. Alternatively, animals require increased concentration or longer exposure to ethanol to elicit the response compared to control animals. In C.elegans the phenotype designation Jud is short for JUDang, which is Korean for resistant to alcohol.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>Jud</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>alcohol resistant</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>WBPhenotype:0001612</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>ethanol resistant</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
