        <obo:IAO_0000115>Cells exhibit variations in the response to osmotic stress compared to control. In C. elegans, exposure to stress-inducing osmotic conditions invokes cellular changes, including transcriptional up or down-regulation of genes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
