        <obo:IAO_0000115>Variations in the biogenesis or stability of the 21U-RNA class of molecules compared to control. Molecules are classified as 21U-RNA based on the presence of a 5&apos;U and a conserved upstream motif, which may specify the production of these molecules, in addition these molecules are typically 21nt in length.</obo:IAO_0000115>
