        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals contain fewer pharyngeal cells compared to control animals.  In C. elegans, pharyngeal cells are derived from MS-blastomere.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
