        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals become paralyzed in response to aggregation of proteins like poly-glutamine or beta-amyloid.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
