        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/WBPhenotype_0001940"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The nucleus-free core of germline cytoplasm in the gonad is not as wide as control animals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
