        <obo:IAO_0000115>Variation of the time an individual spent on a patch of food (bacterial lawn) before leaving, compared to control animals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>food leaving behavior variant</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>patch leaving behavior variant</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
