        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/WBPhenotype_0002142"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The protein complex located in the mitochondrial inner membrane that is the first entry point for electrons into the electron transport chain and catalyzes proton translocation coupled to the oxidation of NADH by ubiquinone, differs in activity, composition, or organization from that of controls.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CO I variant</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Complex I variant</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
