        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/WBPhenotype_0000028"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The production of silencing RNA from dsRNA is significantly deficient compared to controls. Deficiencies in this process can result in a defective RNAi response compared to controls.</obo:IAO_0000115>
