        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals exhibit negative effects on growth, development, or metabolism when exposed to a galactose-rich diet, compared to control animals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
