        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals display variations in the distribution of the constituents of the postsynaptic side of the active zone, compared to control animals, that are required for receiving signals from the presynaptic side.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>WBPhenotype:0002262</oboInOwl:id>
