        <obo:IAO_0000115>Males receive copulatory plugs from other males, deposited on their excretory pores. This phenotype is polymorphic among C. elegans strains and also in C. briggsae.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>Pleb</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
