        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/WBPhenotype_0000662"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals exhibit variations in their movement at high-speed in the forward direction with brief backward movement compared to control. During roaming, control animals often traverse wide regions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
