        <obo:IAO_0000115>A depletion of somatic, but not germline, lipid stores are observed near the end of the reproductive period.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>Asdf</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
