        <obo:IAO_0000115>Animals exposed to an exogenous chemical exhibit an abnormal accumulation of this chemical in the body of the animals, compared to controls.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>C_elegans_phenotype_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
