        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Any variation in the continued movement of sperm through the vas deferens, exiting the cloaca, compared to control. In C. elegans, when all sperm that exit the seminal vesicle have been released, the spicules retract into the male.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>WB:WBPaper00028400</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


