        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any variation in the specific actions or reactions of a hermaphrodite prior to male contact during mating compared to control.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>pre male contact abnormal</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
