        <obo:IAO_0000115>The C. elegans life stage spanning 460-520min after first cleavage at 20 Centigrade. Cell number remains at ~560 cells, with some new cells generated and some cells go through programmed cell death. The shape of embryo is elongated and double fold. A stage between 1.5-fold embryo and 3-fold embryo.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>2-fold embryo</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>worm_development</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>WBls:0000019</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>2-fold embryo Ce</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
