        <obo:IAO_0000115>The C. elegans life stage spanning 520-620min after first cleavage at 20 Centigrade. Cell number remains at ~560 cells, with some new cells generated and some cells go through programmed cell death. The shape of embryo is elongated and tripple fold. A stage between 2-fold embryo and fully-elongated embryo. Also called pretzel embryo or pretzel stage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>3-fold embryo</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
